            "sid": "DEU 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunini aadaafi seera AABBO Waaqi keesani worra kana barsiisi, gorsi naani jed'e. Lafa isani amma tana fud'atani iti qubachuu geettani tana keesati jabeesa guuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga jirtani isanifi ilmaani teesanifi d'alooti keesanileeni ch'ufti. AABBO Waaqa keesani guddiftani aadaafi, seera isaa, ka anini isanii kennu kana, guutuu maltani, aka lubbuuni teesani lafa suni irati d'eerattu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi isani worri Israeli seera kana d'agaya, guuta! Yo akasi taatani, wonti ch'ufti isaanii tolte nagaya isanii taati, duuba isani lafa aananifi dammi, aka lola yau keesati hortani daraartani, akuma AABBO Waaqi, Waaqi abbooti teesani isaniti kakhate kaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
